    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.2897,
      "audio_seconds": 5.2,
      "rtf": 0.248,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4191
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.1117,
      "audio_seconds": 4.44,
      "rtf": 0.2504,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4447
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.4734,
      "audio_seconds": 5.92,
      "rtf": 0.2489,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4079
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.0793,
      "audio_seconds": 4.32,
      "rtf": 0.2498,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.5366
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.9285,
      "audio_seconds": 3.72,
      "rtf": 0.2496,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.427
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_05",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The system works — assuming, of course, that the cache has been warmed first.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.0798,
      "audio_seconds": 4.32,
      "rtf": 0.25,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3428
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_06",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Before deploying, verify the image was rebuilt; a stale image looks identical from outside.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.2793,
      "audio_seconds": 5.2,
      "rtf": 0.246,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4165
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_07",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "She wanted to know why, given everything that had happened, we were still shipping on Friday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/chatterbox-turbo/complex_07.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 1.1414,
      "audio_seconds": 4.6,
      "rtf": 0.2481,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.3696
    },
    {
      "id": "heteronyms_00",
      "category": "heteronyms",
      "text": "I read the report yesterday, and I will read the summary tonight.",
